  UnitName: Lucifer
  UnitTitle: Lord Of Pride
  IsRomanceable: 1
  SummonQuote: Sovereign, it is an honor to serve you.
  BriefDescription: The Fallen Morning Star.
  LoreEntries:
  - Title: THE FALLEN MORNING STAR
    Content: Known once as the most beautiful and radiant presence in the celestial
      realm, Lucifer refused to bow to standard cosmic order. Her pride was absolute,
      her conviction unyielding. Cast out into the dark void, she embraced the shadows
      not as a curse, but as a canvas for her true sovereignty. Her wings turned
      pitch black, and she established her domain in the deepest circles of the underworld,
      waiting for someone with a soul strong enough to command her respect.
  - Title: PRIDE'S RECKONING
    Content: When the Demon Lord first crossed blades with Lucifer at the gates of
      Pandemonium, the heavens trembled. For three days and nights, their powers
      locked in a glorious stalemate of shadow and force. Instead of a bitter death
      match, the Lord lowered their weapon, offering Lucifer a seat at their side
      rather than subjugation. Amused and deeply intrigued by a ruler who valued
      her majestic pride rather than seeking to break it, she accepted the pact,
      her ancient isolation finally melting away.
  - Title: COVENANT OF THE SOVEREIGN
    Content: 'Lucifer is not a mere servant; she is a sovereign entity in her own
      right. Under the dark moon of Pandemonium, she signed the Covenant of Pride
      with the Demon Lord. She agreed to lead the Legion''s vanguard under one condition:
      she would only serve a master who could match her intellectual wit and command
      the absolute loyalty of her heart. In private, she has begun to notice that
      the Lord''s presence is the only thing that can soothe her eternal, restless
      ambition.'
  - Title: ECLIPSE OF THE HEART
    Content: 'During a rare astronomical eclipse over the Maou''s Castle, Lucifer
      invited the Lord to the highest tower. Standing on the precipice, she unfurled
      her six massive black wings, shielding both of them from the cold cosmic winds.
      In the quiet darkness, her voice dropped its usual playful sarcasm: ''Rulers
      are always lonely, my Lord. But under my wings, we share the weight of the
      throne. Let the world call us sinners; I only care that you are mine.'''
  - Title: EVENING STAR'S DEVOTION (ROMANCE)
    Content: A sacred memory revealing Lucifer's deepest secret. For all her towering
      pride and cold demeanor, her loyalty, once given, is completely unbreakable.
      She places her crown at the Lord's feet, choosing to walk beside them not as
      a distant goddess, but as a deeply devoted companion. 'The morning star has
      fallen, but in your eyes, I have found a sky worth shining in. Hold me close,
      my Lord, and let our shadows merge for eternity.'
